{"id":"12E","title":"Slander and Backbiting","part":{"n":12,"title":"Etiquette and moral issues"},"url":"/law/12-etiquette-and-moral-issues/12e","entries":[{"id":"12E.1","text":"Slander and speaking lies about your brethren is an abomination to God.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":6,"verses":"16,19"}],"citation":"Prov. 6:16, 19."},{"id":"12E.2","text":"You shall not go about speaking slander or spreading false reports about others.","refs":[{"book":"Exodus","chapter":23,"verses":"1"},{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":19,"verses":"16"},{"book":"Luke","chapter":3,"verses":"14"},{"book":"Titus","chapter":2,"verses":"3"},{"book":"James","chapter":4,"verses":"11"}],"citation":"Exod. 23:1; Lev. 19:16; Luke 3:14; Titus 2:3; James 4:11."},{"id":"12E.3","text":"You shall not backbite others.","refs":[{"book":"Psalms","chapter":15,"verses":"1"},{"book":"Romans","chapter":1,"verses":"30"},{"book":"2 Corinthians","chapter":12,"verses":"20"}],"citation":"Psa. 15:1 1 3; Rom. 1:30; 2 Cor. 12:20."},{"id":"12E.4","text":"A backbiting tongue brings forth an angry countenance (no one will be pleased with a backbiter).","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":25,"verses":"23"}],"citation":"Prov. 25:23."},{"id":"12E.5","text":"A talebearer who spreads scandals causes harm to others.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":18,"verses":"8"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":26,"verses":"20,22"}],"citation":"Prov. 18:8; Prov. 26:20, 22."},{"id":"12E.6","text":"He who does not backbite and slander with his tongue is near to God.","refs":[{"book":"Psalms","chapter":15,"verses":"1-3"}],"citation":"Psa. 15:1- 3."},{"id":"12E.7","text":"We should not speak evil of someone out of suspicions or assumptions.","refs":[{"book":"1 Timothy","chapter":6,"verses":"4"}],"citation":"1 Tim. 6:4."},{"id":"12E.8","text":"Beware of those who are slanderers.","refs":[{"book":"2 Timothy","chapter":3,"verses":"3"}],"citation":"2 Tim. 3:3."},{"id":"12E.9","text":"Slander is a characteristic of the wicked.","refs":[{"book":"Psalms","chapter":31,"verses":"13"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":50,"verses":"16,20"},{"book":"Jeremiah","chapter":6,"verses":"28"}],"citation":"Psa. 31:13; Psa. 50:16, 20; Jer. 6:28."},{"id":"12E.10","text":"Libel and name calling is condemned by Christ.","refs":[{"book":"Matthew","chapter":5,"verses":"22"}],"citation":"Matt. 5:22."},{"id":"12E.11","text":"He that speaks slander is a fool.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":10,"verses":"18"}],"citation":"Prov. 10: 18."},{"id":"12E.12","text":"Those who indulge in slander are not to be trusted.","refs":[{"book":"Jeremiah","chapter":9,"verses":"4"}],"citation":"Jer. 9:4."},{"id":"12E.13","text":"Slander is a sign of a debauched and corrupt people.","refs":[{"book":"Jeremiah","chapter":6,"verses":"28"},{"book":"Jeremiah","chapter":9,"verses":"4"},{"book":"Ezekiel","chapter":22,"verses":"9"}],"citation":"Jer. 6:28; Jer. 9:4; Ezek. 22:9."},{"id":"12E.14","text":"We are commanded to put away all such evil speaking.","refs":[{"book":"Ephesians","chapter":4,"verses":"31"},{"book":"1 Peter","chapter":2,"verses":"1"}],"citation":"Eph. 4:31; 1 Pet 2:1."},{"id":"12E.15","text":"You shall not go about as a slanderer among your people.","refs":[{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":19,"verses":"16"},{"book":"2 Corinthians","chapter":12,"verses":"20"}],"citation":"Lev. 19:16; 2 Cor. 12:20."},{"id":"12E.16","text":"You are to speak evil of no man.","refs":[{"book":"Titus","chapter":3,"verses":"2"},{"book":"James","chapter":4,"verses":"11"}],"citation":"Titus 3:2; James 4:11."},{"id":"12E.17","text":"He who secretly slanders his neighbor is to be cut off from the people.","refs":[{"book":"Psalms","chapter":101,"verses":"5"}],"citation":"Psa. 101:5."}]}